    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d207">

                <pb facs="0353" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg241"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Reid to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-12-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 30, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1122.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the department’s cable of
                    the 14th instant containing a memorandum to be presented to the foreign office
                    in regard to the commercial neutralization of the Manchurian railways, I have
                    the honor to inclose herewith a note from the foreign office, dated the 29th
                    instant, in reply to the memorandum. The substance of this note was cabled to
                    the department yesterday in my No. 534.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitelaw Reid.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d207-a1.xml" xpointer="d207-a1"/>
